Rule 1 (image dtype must be numeric/complex, not bool/str/dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
>>
Rule 2 (image must be at least 3-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 3 (image must be at most 4-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ 4
>>
Rule 4 (inner three dims [height, width, channels] must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 3) > 0
